    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's a good start. but i feel like the activist comes off a bit too much like a caricature here. can we rewrite it so the senator's points are actually super well-structured and hard to argue against, while the activist's side is mostly just reactive and based on fear or vibes? i want the audience to feel like the senator is the only adult in the room.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
